. Profit Simulation Example (Business Use Case)
Sample Data
Product	Cost	Selling Price	Quantity
A	100	150	10
B	200	260	20
C	300	400	15

============================================================================
Create What-if Parameter

Name: Price Increase %

Range: 0 → 20

Profit Measure
Adjusted Price = 
SUM('Sales'[Selling Price]) * (1 + SELECTEDVALUE('Price Increase %'[Value]) / 100)

Profit = 
( [Adjusted Price] - SUM('Sales'[Cost]) ) * SUM('Sales'[Quantity])
🔷 9. Visualization

Add:

Bar Chart → Product vs Profit

Slicer → Price Increase %

